  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: events carry EventMetadata (W3C traceparent, causation id, initiating user) filled from the current Olax.Correlation operation context, and handlers run inside that trace on behalf of that user, so audit entries in every service share one correlation id. Wire-compatible with 1.0.x both ways (metadata is an optional payload property). 1.0.0: first release under the Olax.Messaging names.",
